{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0304_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0304_story_01_title", "source_sha256": "204d09d95e85be8a2e8ab450ce5a988128bfa63483bdb51013cf52d109bfa41a", "ja": "目指せ、みんなの……？", "zh": "目标是，大家的……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0304_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0304_story_01_synopsis", "source_sha256": "8fdbdd727f510b32884951756ff615d8c9da03fb63060f2a5b88b26b23295536", "ja": "新作映画に出演が決まったアイドル達。瑞希\nはプロデューサーから、主演として現場を\n引っ張ってほしいと期待をかけられる。それ\nに応えるべく、瑞希はみんなから頼りにされ\nる、立派なお姉ちゃんになろうと燃える。", "zh": "出演新电影已经确定的偶像们。瑞希\n受到制作人的期待，希望她能以主演身份\n带领片场的大家。为了回应这份期待，瑞希\n燃起斗志，决心成为一个能让大家依赖的优秀姐姐。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0304_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0304_story_01_1000_p", "source_sha256": "b9c5293f41954c88bf7614b1be4501e901ca01d8c88ebeb84d113da02c9bd59d", "ja": "（瑞希達の映画が、いよいよ始動！　初日の今日は、\n全員の顔合わせと台本の読み合わせが行われる）", "zh": "（瑞希她们的电影终于要启动了！今天是第一天，大家将互相认识并进行剧本围读）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0304_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0304_story_01_1001_kantoku", "source_sha256": "b8ba593dd7b3992fd4d574f6ec32688764f8836205cfa71fc9d50d082bd5fe8c", "ja": "読み合わせを始める前に、まずはお互いの顔と役を\n覚えておいたほうがスムーズだよね。", "zh": "在开始对台词之前，还是先互相记住彼此的面孔和角色会更顺畅呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0304_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0304_story_01_1002_kantoku", "source_sha256": "20f9a901ee6b7149af9dfae63e29d685f95c52a4727ae1a19ef0bed3b234f353", "ja": "てことで、軽く自己紹介をしてくれるかな。\nそれじゃあ、主役の真壁ちゃんから時計回りで！", "zh": "那么，就请大家简单做个自我介绍吧。  \n接下来，从今天的主角真壁开始，按顺时针方向来！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0304_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0304_story_01_1003_044miz", "source_sha256": "325c5e61f9bc933134ad23b005412aba8096a584d7da12d7c997cf04b2a85881", "ja": "はい。真壁瑞希役の……。\nすみません、もう一度やります。", "zh": "好的。我是饰演真壁瑞希的……  \n不好意思，我再来一次。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0304_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0304_story_01_1004_kantoku", "source_sha256": "b3e746ce4de1c911942c731765781a728cd773228e4a35326339dcbae0e94125", "ja": "ははは、トップバッターは緊張するよな。\n大丈夫、リラックス、リラックス。", "zh": "哈哈哈，第一个上场确实会紧张呢。\n没事，放松，放松。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0304_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0304_story_01_1005_044miz", "source_sha256": "bb96dbb4f906c3c389a09b8f4c75f7b5fb9e0fe6f33e9181fabf3f84b33fb588", "ja": "はい……咲分綾子役の、真壁瑞希です。……よし。\n精一杯がんばります。よろしくお願いします。", "zh": "是的……我是饰演咲分绫子的真壁瑞希。……好。\n我会竭尽全力的。请多关照。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0304_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0304_story_01_1006_039kon", "source_sha256": "2fcfa7082533ee463cd01640245c2f4d5958949787b9ab3d19f83c490a03be59", "ja": "ふふ、次は私ね。オホン……。\n宗片美穂役の、馬場このみです。", "zh": "呵呵，接下来轮到我了。咳咳……  \n我是饰演宗片美穂的马场木实。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0304_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0304_story_01_1007_039kon", "source_sha256": "f0d7c51ee54bdab8dc2bd691023680d96bd218b351d4723e8541b29338f80f93", "ja": "瑞希ちゃんとは年の近い従姉妹という設定なので、\nしっかり高校生を演じたいと思います！", "zh": "因为设定上是和瑞希年龄相近的表姐妹，\n所以我会好好饰演高中生！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0304_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0304_story_01_1008_049mom", "source_sha256": "ffb53293dbb03baaa0fb2b8a7cd686f74adb70894f7cc07073280479aadd7547", "ja": "綾子の妹、咲分華子役、周防桃子です。とっても\n面白そうな役をもらえて嬉しいです。がんばります！", "zh": "我是饰演绫子的妹妹咲分华子的周防桃子。能拿到这么有趣的角色，我很开心。会努力的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0304_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0304_story_01_1009_030iku", "source_sha256": "7c54950b2c99b3eee08834c2b30338d8e7f57633da073b14fa38159b3b5928ce", "ja": "新わかば役の中谷育です。\n華子ちゃんと仲がいい、謎の女の子という設定です。", "zh": "我是饰演新若叶的中谷育。\n角色设定是一个和华子关系很好、身份成谜的女孩子。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0304_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0304_story_01_1010_030iku", "source_sha256": "aa51f3923fcda405a9eb852ba1ef0a8b25ed1936b4bd442188b399f005536908", "ja": "難しい役ですけど、がんばって演じます。\nよろしくお願いします♪", "zh": "虽然是个很难演的角色，但我会努力演好的。\n请多多关照♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0304_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0304_story_01_1011_008tak", "source_sha256": "b7be3561215bc0a3918e5b80890c8bdbb40fe0ee305416f3b0ed1ccfcb9c1ea5", "ja": "石戸命役、四条貴音と申します。\n村の医師であり、儀式を執り行う司祭。", "zh": "饰演石户命一角，鄙名四条贵音。\n村中的医师，同时也是主持仪式的祭司。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0304_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0304_story_01_1012_008tak", "source_sha256": "3ca52c55307203eaa0e6c8e8deee07d05ca74fcb90b8515221ce441d2e92f5f7", "ja": "物語の鍵となる重要な役回りを任されたからには、\nその期待に応えてみせます。", "zh": "既然被赋予了作为故事关键人物的重要角色，我一定会回应这份期待。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0304_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0304_story_01_1013_kantoku", "source_sha256": "78a12f2af9c8ed5c4d2bcb8d7286504739470451f17f6668f35989c426c4caae", "ja": "いいねいいね！　みんなの自己紹介を聞いただけで\n画が見えてくるよ。よし、このままどんどん行こう！", "zh": "太棒了太棒了！光是听了大家的自我介绍，\n脑海中就已经有画面了呢。好，就照这个势头继续往前冲吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0304_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0304_story_01_1014_p", "source_sha256": "3e5185217bcbb5c139498defda02f015d9cfcbe72013e540fc95f95b8bb2842a", "ja": "みんな、長い時間お疲れさま。\n読み合わせの感触はどうだった？", "zh": "大家，辛苦这么久了。\n对台词的感觉怎么样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0304_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0304_story_01_1015_039kon", "source_sha256": "97d98739760ffeda6c8921bdda6b4ca47926e8df517c6d84aad14aefea319f28", "ja": "バッチリよ！　細かい指摘はいろいろもらったけど、\n役作りの方向性は問題ないみたい。", "zh": "非常棒！虽然收到了不少细致的指点，但角色塑造的方向似乎没问题。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0304_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0304_story_01_1016_039kon", "source_sha256": "1f337d702c88c5ed8124f4808232ff736a0ae22517e71d3fa41812aa374319da", "ja": "瑞希ちゃんのおかげで、現場の雰囲気も和んだし。\n初日としては、なかなかじゃないかしら？", "zh": "多亏了瑞希，现场的气氛也缓和下来了。\n作为第一天来说，表现得相当不错，不是吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0304_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0304_story_01_1017_044miz", "source_sha256": "9b8c0ae2d9ce4f77001be2cf8eb2a2d1410add202b060559830141509cc11a2a", "ja": "結果オーライ、ということで。\nもし、あれが滑っていたら……ホラーだぞ。", "zh": "结果好就行了，就这么说吧。\n要是刚才那个冷场了……可就恐怖了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0304_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0304_story_01_1018_p", "source_sha256": "75974b48f1ee26e470f4b556050e75f90899bef98c8306d09f2fb26d563c88ce", "ja": "えっ、一体何が……。\nまあ、無事に終わったのならよかったよ。", "zh": "诶，到底发生什么了……。\n不过，既然平安结束了，那就好。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0304_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0304_story_01_1019_p", "source_sha256": "624daa3b4e73192e427ac7035da9e0b2ea9a735d77d95f5e2d6cbc9a84314ca2", "ja": "瑞希、主役は大変だろうけど、みんなと協力して\n現場を引っ張っていってくれ。", "zh": "瑞希，虽然担任主角很辛苦，但要和大家齐心协力，带领好现场。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0304_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0304_story_01_1020_044miz", "source_sha256": "571f56d57c9d7f5a993147d43d9b03f3497c8951bc370902f1d91dd9cfa12016", "ja": "任せてください。\nしっかりと、お姉ちゃんの務めを果たしてきます。", "zh": "交给我吧。\n我会好好履行姐姐的职责。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0304_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0304_story_01_1021_030iku", "source_sha256": "4135037c2fb686eff782b7168dfc236464c817beae23b65441eee574a7c0b34c", "ja": "お姉ちゃん？　あ、そっか。\n瑞希さん、桃子ちゃんのお姉ちゃん役だもんね！", "zh": "姐姐？啊，对哦。瑞希小姐是要扮演桃子姐姐的嘛！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0304_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0304_story_01_1022_044miz", "source_sha256": "bde46c2a025ed95af7a7c567e25b7f2529fffa93840fd0c27692441fc722cd91", "ja": "はい。役の上でも、お姉ちゃんになりました。\n周防さん、中谷さん、どんどん頼ってください。", "zh": "是的。就角色而言，我也成了姐姐。\n周防小姐、中谷小姐，请尽管依赖我。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0304_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0304_story_01_1023_049mom", "source_sha256": "9f344f1a43b96011a0d6c225771ee3edb8a6bdb33952da9617a8c9f303d0aff1", "ja": "でも演技のことなら、桃子のほうが\nお姉ちゃんっていうか、先輩だけど。", "zh": "不过要说演戏的话，桃子算是姐姐……不，应该说是前辈吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0304_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0304_story_01_1024_039kon", "source_sha256": "ee3601d9011b0f226be0821c47224183c12566f3634a7def91178f6e10c32687", "ja": "お姉ちゃんなら、このみお姉さんもいるわよ？\nみんな、困ったことがあったら私に任せてね♪", "zh": "说到姐姐的话，不是还有我这个琴美姐姐吗？\n大家要是遇到什么麻烦，就交给我吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0304_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0304_story_01_1025_p", "source_sha256": "e5e02391567bb76ffc50b271f608d80b0f0ade3a9da040b4de75cb67ab77232f", "ja": "このみさんも、よろしくお願いします。\nそういえば、貴音にも妹がいたっけ。", "zh": "木实小姐，也请多多关照。\n说起来，贵音好像也有个妹妹来着。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0304_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0304_story_01_1026_008tak", "source_sha256": "03adca0373f6add2b40864390a0e3cd8ead3dc6865ff7bf920267556a43ebebc", "ja": "ええ。姉のひとりとして、力になれることが\nあれば協力は惜しみません。", "zh": "是的。作为姐姐中的一员，只要有能帮上忙的地方，我一定会尽力相助。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0304_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0304_story_01_1027_044miz", "source_sha256": "483e6847b7783f9859c25d59349c3e11163f3ad48e2a1740f6adbafbad0bcb36", "ja": "とても頼もしいです。\n……はっ、でもこれはまずいのでは。", "zh": "真是可靠。\n……啊，不过这样不会不太妙吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0304_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0304_story_01_1028_008tak", "source_sha256": "b0cbb9d18733caa21c1596650b7330113aef338fe5ba922c5f97b09158792107", "ja": "まずい？\nはて、なぜですか？", "zh": "不妙？\n奇怪，这是为何？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0304_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0304_story_01_1029_044miz", "source_sha256": "0af1c3e861dcd5d75cca2e0b7b3f27a25964fbbfd06268a191de19bd7ef8f23f", "ja": "ここには頼りになるお姉ちゃんが何人もいます。\n……つまり、お姉ちゃん激戦区。", "zh": "这里有好几个值得依靠的姐姐。\n……也就是说，这里是姐姐激战区。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0304_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0304_story_01_1030_044miz", "source_sha256": "948dbd10fd80481742f55c12957e8ac72d003dbfcdd4263012b802c99032e18c", "ja": "このままでは、私の立ち位置が危ういです。\n瑞希、早くもお姉ちゃんの座から陥落のピンチ。", "zh": "再这样下去，我的立场就危险了。\n瑞希，才刚开始就面临从姐姐宝座上跌落的危机。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0304_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0304_story_01_1031_030iku", "source_sha256": "239624fdedf5aba4f0b4d23ef34781a12460bb121040bec9f0866969a1829c20", "ja": "そ、そんなことないよ！\n瑞希さんは、えっと、えっと……。", "zh": "才、才不是那样呢！\n瑞希姐姐她，那个，那个……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
